[gd_scene load_steps=14 format=3]

; Persistent ambient lava-geyser VFX for brimstone biome lane-side scenery.
; Place as a child of the geyser rock mesh at the vent opening (Y ~ top of rock).
; All particles run looping — no auto-destroy.

